# The node detail showing the four sensor groups beyond device metrics and environment.
#
# The groups only appear for a node that actually reported them, which is the whole reason they
# are separate groups: a plain handheld shows none, a solar repeater shows power, an indoor
# sensor shows air quality, a base station running meshtasticd shows a filesystem. This walks
# the ones the demo mesh has.

scene demo
tab nodes

# Echo Repeater: a solar node with a two-channel current monitor.
key down 5
key a
key down 12
hold 1200
key b

# Golf Cabin: an indoor particulate and CO2 sensor.
key down 2
key a
key down 12
hold 1200
key b
